 "title": "Brauer group",
 "statement": "For $C$ as in [def-sc-curves], the *Brauer group* of $C$ is\n$\\Br(C)=H^2(C_{\\Et},\\mathbb G_m)$, the cohomology of the sheaf\n$\\mathbb G_m$ of [def-sc-gm-torsor] on the small etale site\n$C_{\\Et}$ ([def-weil-pbc-etale-site]).",
